            "description": "Downloads ~5 years of daily OHLCV bars for **every security in the database** plus the `KSE100` index. Safe to re-run — existing days are skipped.\n\nThe id is a **broker account** id: the market session is obtained by following that account's analytics hand-off, so a live broker session (linked within the last 15 minutes) is needed — or `DASHBOARD_COOKIE` set in `.env` as a fallback.\n\nSymbols are fetched one after another; with many securities this request can take a while. Raise the Postman request timeout if needed (Settings → General → Request timeout).\n\n**Responses**\n- `200` `{ message: \"success\", data: { securities, newRows, results: [ { symbol, fetched, saved } | { symbol, error } ] } }`\n- `401` `{ error: \"Broker session expired. Reconnect the account so a market session can be issued.\" }`\n- `401` `{ error: \"The broker did not return an analytics URL.\" }` / `\"The dashboard handoff did not return a session cookie.\"`\n- `404` `{ error: \"account does not exist\" }`"
